## 4. Optimization approach
1. Reproduce the issue before changing code.
2. Identify the smallest safe fix.
3. Run a targeted test.
4. Run a broader regression check.
5. Record evidence and remaining limitations.
6. Avoid claiming speedups unless measured before and after under comparable conditions.

